@model object
@{
    ViewBag.Title = "环形图";
    var F = Html.F();
}

@section body {
    @(F.Chart().ID("ChartPieDoughnut").Height(550).CategoryField("Category")
        .ShowLegend(true)
        .LegendTop("5%")
        .PieRadius("40%,70%")
        .PieShowLabel(false)
        .PieLabelPosition("center")
        .PieEmphasisLabelSize(40)
        .PieEmphasisLabelFontWeight("bold")
        .Series("source", ChartSeriesType.Pie, "Access From", "Value")
        .DataSource(Model))
    <p>内半径留出圆心空间，指向扇区可在中央显示分类名称。<a href="https://echarts.apache.org/examples/zh/editor.html?c=pie-doughnut" target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看 Apache ECharts 原始示例</a>。</p>
}
